{"id":"f6a3d5bf0214e6eb","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-lob-to-second.md","title":"Löb Theorem Implies Second Incompleteness","display":"prop-lob-to-second — Löb Theorem Implies Second Incompleteness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-lob-to-second","aliases":["92-prop-lob-to-second"],"display":"prop-lob-to-second — Löb Theorem Implies Second Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[92-thm-lob-theorem]]","[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 p. 110，Kreisel 的推论（PDF 127）","source_status":"原书定理的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-lob-to-second"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-lob-to-second</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-lob-to-second — Löb Theorem Implies Second Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd30fbde88ab93eb\" href=\"?note=fd30fbde88ab93eb\" title=\"92-thm-lob-theorem\">92-thm-lob-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57ea3ea286817df3\" href=\"?note=57ea3ea286817df3\" title=\"92-thm-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-second-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 110，Kreisel 的推论（PDF 127）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书定理的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (internal consistency sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}second}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}second}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Löb定理蕴含第二不完备性定理</li>\n<li>证明思路：\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\leftrightarrow(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G)\\bigr)\">\\(G\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\leftrightarrow(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G)\\bigr)\\)</span></li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>由Löb定理得<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\bot_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\bot_G\\)</span>，与外部一致性<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>矛盾</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>在标准Hilbert–Bernays–Löb条件下，这正是由Löb定理推出的第二不完备性结论</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这个推理的 Löb 实例正确：前件是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}(\\bot_G)\\to\\bot_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}(\\bot_G)\\to\\bot_G\\)</span>，与同一个句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> 的可证性对应。由一致性句获得前件，Löb 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span>，与一致性矛盾。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 110，Kreisel 的推论（PDF 127）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"fd30fbde88ab93eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"57ea3ea286817df3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-contradiction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]